    A few 2D correlation examples:

    >>> x = jnp.array([[2, 1, 3],
    ...                [1, 3, 1],
    ...                [4, 1, 2]])
    >>> y = jnp.array([[1, 3],
    ...                [4, 2]])

    Full 2D correlation uses implicit zero-padding at the edges:

    >>> jax.scipy.signal.correlate2d(x, y, mode='full')
